# Filtered to what this repository actually contains. ADR-0010's split lost the
# root `.gitignore` to `git subtree split` and swept 2038 files of `target/`
# into the first commit before anyone noticed; the quiet half of that failure
# was a secrets rule going missing at the same time. So this exists before the
# first crate lands, not after.

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.token
secrets.*
# ...but not source files that merely deal with the subject. In the daemon's
# repository `secrets.*` swallowed a real module and every fresh clone failed to
# build. Nothing here is named that today; the exception is kept so that adding
# one does not reintroduce the same silence.
!secrets.rs

# ── Rust ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/

# ── OS / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
